OL,3,GNEWSACordon as bomb squad investigate
OL,4,A'suspicious' item
OL,5,
OL,6,FA large city area has been cordoned off
OL,7,Fby police as a bomb disposal team
OL,8,Fattends an incident.
OL,10,FPark Street in Bristol has been closed
OL,11,Fafter a member of the public reported a
OL,12,Fman leaving a suspicious item in the
OL,13,Farea at about 08:25 BST.
OL,15,FAvon and Somerset Police said a 50m
OL,16,F(164 ft) cordon is in place, which
OL,17,Fincludes Hill Street, St George's Road
OL,18,Fand Frogmore Street.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
